    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists just tell u \"it gets better\" but it doesn't change the fact that i'm still sitting here draining their energy every single day. it's like, no matter how much i try, i'm just a constant drain on their time and money. i look at them and all i see is how much they've had to sacrifice just to keep me going. it feels so selfish to keep dragging them through this.",
